:Lobby_Cafe rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                     :Restaurant .


###  http://example.org/kr25/restaurant#Morning_Buffet
:Morning_Buffet rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                         :Restaurant .


###  http://example.org/kr25/restaurant#Spice_Garden
:Spice_Garden rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       :Restaurant .


